<title>LITHUANIA: SASTATAS H1 97 LOSSES 102,000 LITAS.</title>
<headline>SASTATAS H1 97 LOSSES 102,000 LITAS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first half of 1997</p>
<p>					(million litas unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net losses		     102,000	  vs 18,000</p>
<p>    Turnover			 1.624	    vs 1.076</p>
<p>    Operating costs		1.385	    vs 947,000</p>
<p>    Operating profit	     8,800 litas    vs losses 45,000</p>
<p>    Gross profit		   238,000	  vs 129,000</p>
<p>    Pre-tax losses		 102,000	  vs 18,000</p>
<p>NOTE -- Sastatas , a construction materials</p>
<p>producer, posted a 54,000 litas net profit and 2.75 million</p>
<p>litas turnover for 1996.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 223 518</p>
</text>
